#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:5
#: 9ece75b77f2b46aa867a8ff72a2c3b1e
msgid "History of ArduPilot"
msgstr "ArduPilot 历史"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:11
#: 5c710b2cb86a4659a2b3836bd57ae850
msgid ""
"May 2007 - Chris Anderson starts `DIYDrones.com <https://diydrones.com/>`__ "
"while building his `Lego mindstorm base UAV "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GC2qs0WpL7w>`__."
msgstr ""
"2007 年 5 月 - Chris Anderson 在构建其 `乐高 Mindstorm 无人机 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GC2qs0WpL7w>`__ 的过程中创立了 `DIYDrones.com "
"<https://diydrones.com/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:14
#: d070d68f839e4130b96e464234aa2e64
msgid ""
"Sep 2008 - Jordi builds traditional helicopter UAV able to `fly autonomously"
" "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=20Z9VSvAAug&list=UU0sMZYj_oTmZmXMfBzqDyjg>`__"
" and `wins the first Sparkfun AVC competition "
"<https://avc.sparkfun.com/2009>`__."
msgstr ""
"2008 年 9 月 - Jordi 构建了能够 `自主飞行 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=20Z9VSvAAug&list=UU0sMZYj_oTmZmXMfBzqDyjg>`__"
" 的传统直升机无人机，并 `赢得了首届 Sparkfun AVC 竞赛 <https://avc.sparkfun.com/2009>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:21
#: 5e455b91774445f392c61decc45e2704
msgid "Jordi's traditional helicopter"
msgstr "Jordi 的传统直升机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:23
#: 2e20e79be81040e5a8de5b5c8051c3cc
msgid "2009 - Chris Anderson & Jordi Munoz found 3D Robotics"
msgstr "2009 年 - Chris Anderson 与 Jordi Munoz 共同创立 3D Robotics"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:25
#: f9a6c095a3bd486ab88b129855435f5e
msgid ""
"May 2009 - `First ArduPilot board "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-how-to-reflash>`__ (using "
"`thermopiles <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/attopilot-ir-sensors-"
"now>`__) released by Jordi/3DRobotics"
msgstr ""
"2009 年 5 月 - Jordi/3DRobotics 发布了`首款 ArduPilot 板 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-how-to-reflash>`__（使用`热电堆 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/attopilot-ir-sensors-now>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:30
#: 0aaee6d890974674ad40b05cf6422b04
msgid ""
"Nov 2009 - `ArduPilot code repository "
"<https://code.google.com/p/ardupilot/>`__ created by Jordi"
msgstr ""
"2009 年 11 月 - Jordi 创建 `ArduPilot 代码仓库 "
"<https://code.google.com/p/ardupilot/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:32
#: 47897910dce74eacb463771820d4893c
msgid ""
"Nov 2009 - First version of ArduIMU written by Jordi, Doug Weibel, Jose "
"Julio using DCM from William Premerlani"
msgstr ""
"2009 年 11 月 - 首版 ArduIMU 由 Jordi、Doug Weibel、Jose Julio 使用 William "
"Premerlani 的 DCM 算法编写"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:35
#: 7a81bb98253f4988903959e1667cc2a1
msgid ""
"Nov 2009 - Feb 2010 – ArduPilot rewritten from scratch (v2.5) by Jason and "
"includes interrupt driven RC input, RC throttle failsafe, RTL, Loiter, "
"Circle, Crosstrack correction, decent stabilization, Fly-By-Wire, system "
"events, 4 channel RC output, and 2-way telemetry. (`Post "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-25-final>`__)"
msgstr ""
"2009 年 11 月 - 2010 年 2 月 – Jason 从零重写 ArduPilot（v2.5），包含中断驱动的 RC 输入、RC "
"油门失控保护、RTL、Loiter、Circle、航迹纠偏、姿态稳定、线控飞行、系统事件、4 路 RC 输出和双向遥测。（`文章 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-25-final>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:41
#: 4c861c6f51e744e59df2adcfa0305c1b
msgid ""
"Dec 2009 - `First IMU based autonomous plane mission "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arduimupilot-flys-first>`__ flown by "
"Doug with modified ArduPilot v2.4."
msgstr ""
"2009 年 12 月 - Doug 使用改进的 ArduPilot v2.4 完成了`首次基于 IMU 的自主飞机飞行任务 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arduimupilot-flys-first>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:44
#: 1b618dd2641b4dc9975c16583cf1c22b
msgid "2010 - APM1 released by 3d Robotics"
msgstr "2010 年 - 3d Robotics 发布 APM1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:46
#: e443ef84a36d452dbe06e7290f3b62f7
msgid ""
"Early 2010 - ArduPilot 2.6 released by Doug and Jason with improved throttle"
" control, and ArduIMU support."
msgstr "2010 年初 - Doug 和 Jason 发布 ArduPilot 2.6，改进了油门控制并支持 ArduIMU。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:49
#: 193883000d934b67a3a0ceb39280cb8e
msgid "Summer 2010 - APM Code development:"
msgstr "2010 年夏 - APM 代码开发："

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:51
#: dbf9327b7c9a44058ca9367f956c41e1
msgid "Jason - Mission scripting, Flight modes, Navigation"
msgstr "Jason - 任务脚本、飞行模式、导航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:52
#: 38a861e9efee49fb82272d2c5fbb05ed
msgid "Jose - Code Libraries, DCM, and HW sensor support"
msgstr "Jose - 代码库、DCM 和硬件传感器支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:53
#: 0d556bbf25c3477e9f9e47fce300fd1c
msgid "Doug - Advanced flight control, logging, DCM"
msgstr "Doug - 高级飞行控制、日志记录、DCM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:54
#: 9e0f929b04884416baa5a1c0972b8bf0
msgid "MikeS - Parameters, CLI, Fast Serial, advanced hardware optimizations"
msgstr "MikeS - 参数、CLI、快速串口、高级硬件优化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:56
#: 3db9f202577145e4af55aa1319289eaf
msgid ""
"May 2010 - `ArduPilot merges with AeroQuad (including Jani Hirvinen) and "
"begins work on CopterNG <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/announcing-"
"arducopter-the>`__"
msgstr ""
"2010 年 5 月 - `ArduPilot 与 AeroQuad（包括 Jani Hirvinen）合并并开始研发 CopterNG "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/announcing-arducopter-the>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:58
#: 4917714311874020945b3346086a7eb5
msgid ""
"June 2010 - APM 1 flies first autonomous and scripted mission in SW (`post "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-megas-first-complete>`__)"
msgstr ""
"2010 年 6 月 - APM 1 在西南地区完成首次自主和脚本化飞行任务（`文章 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-megas-first-complete>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:61
#: 5ab287a24c1743998e8c1d08d49579a9
msgid ""
"June 2010 - APM 1 takes first `autonomous Plane flights "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-mega-moves-off-the>`__"
msgstr ""
"2010 年 6 月 - APM 1 完成首次`自主固定翼飞行 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-mega-moves-off-the>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:63
#: 997c388f592749c984128f1b7288c248
msgid ""
"July 2010 - Perl based Hardware-in-the-loop developed by Jason for Xplane "
"for testing new APM mission scripting commands in (later integrated into "
"Mavlink)(\\ `Post <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/x-plane-"
"integration>`__)"
msgstr ""
"2010 年 7 月 - Jason 为 Xplane 开发了基于 Perl 的硬件在环仿真，用于测试新的 APM 任务脚本命令（后来集成到 "
"MAVLink 中）（\\ `文章 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/x-plane-"
"integration>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:68
#: 2cd2fcfdfad64ed0aa61d02b8f93ce3b
msgid ""
"Aug 2010 - `Jani/jDrones ships first DIY quad frames "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-unboxing>`__ which were "
"adopted as the original standard"
msgstr ""
"2010 年 8 月 - `Jani/jDrones 发货首批 DIY 四轴机架 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-unboxing>`__，被采用为原始标准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:71
#: 75c7ec45ab4242efbbe406a7f4e6eca2
msgid ""
"Oct 2010 - CopterNG (AeroQuad/ArduCopter merged code) project abandoned by "
"ArduPilot team and handed over, with encouragement, to the `ArduPirates "
"<https://code.google.com/p/ardupirates/>`__ team for further development. "
"Jason restarts Copter with alternative control logic based on Plane making "
"Copter autonomous. Adds Loiter, Circle, RTL, Mission scripting, failsafe, "
"takeoff, landing, etc."
msgstr ""
"2010 年 10 月 - CopterNG（AeroQuad/ArduCopter 合并代码）项目被 ArduPilot 团队放弃，并在鼓励下移交给 "
"`ArduPirates <https://code.google.com/p/ardupirates/>`__ 团队继续开发。Jason 基于 "
"Plane 的替代控制逻辑重启 Copter 开发，使其具备自主能力。增加了 Loiter、Circle、RTL、任务脚本、失控保护、起飞、降落等功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:78
#: 23b7390a154a4183aa690a44fd31f648
msgid ""
"Aug 2010 - `the Mission Planner "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-mega-mission-planner>`__ is "
"released by Michael Oborne"
msgstr ""
"2010 年 8 月 - Michael Oborne 发布了 `Mission Planner "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ardupilot-mega-mission-planner>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:81
#: a367338c76b3415494b5f23113a7081e
msgid ""
"Aug 2010 - `TradHeli support <https://vimeo.com/14135066>`__ added by Randy"
msgstr "2010 年 8 月 - Randy 添加了`传统直升机支持 <https://vimeo.com/14135066>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:84
#: e496c705093546b696c3bd1a8922f1f4
msgid ""
"Dec 2010 - First successful fork of ArduPilot code as `MegaPirates group "
"extends original CopterNG code "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-ng-taken-over-by>`__"
msgstr ""
"2010 年 12 月 - ArduPilot 代码首次成功分叉，`MegaPirates 团队扩展了原始 CopterNG 代码 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-ng-taken-over-by>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:86
#: 3dda1164b5784eda8004df5e48e39ea7
msgid ""
"April 2011 – First fully autonomous Copter mission flown by Jason at "
"`Sparkfun AVC <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/acm-at-the-avc>`__"
msgstr ""
"2011 年 4 月 – Jason 在 `Sparkfun AVC "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/acm-at-the-avc>`__ 完成首次全自主 Copter 任务飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:89
#: 1a8cb7334cc84d5db54d80a71bf2fdd2
msgid ""
"April 2011 - Laser Navigation made the first piece of 32 bit hardware "
"capable of running the ArduCopter software"
msgstr "2011 年 4 月 - Laser Navigation 制造了首款能够运行 ArduCopter 软件的 32 位硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:91
#: 1a19e76d91e24e0c8a150869a1b50531
msgid "2011 - APM2 released by 3D Robotics"
msgstr "2011 年 - 3D Robotics 发布 APM2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:93
#: 4773e3733cf24258a2e26562d134ccb5
msgid ""
"Nov 2011 - `AutoTester <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ is created by "
"Tridge"
msgstr ""
"2011 年 11 月 - Tridge 创建 `AutoTester <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:96
#: b387a27dee06497ca0499c700f7e61cb
msgid "2012 - APM2.5/2.6 released by 3D Robotics"
msgstr "2012 年 - 3D Robotics 发布 APM2.5/2.6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:98
#: c33e1573a2dc4011902f89f952d0f1a3
msgid ""
"Feb 2012 - Jason asks Randy to take over and be lead developer of Copter, "
"Doug goes off to get his PhD and Tridge takes over Plane"
msgstr ""
"2012 年 2 月 - Jason 请 Randy 接手并担任 Copter 首席开发者，Doug 去攻读博士学位，Tridge 接手 Plane"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:101
#: 72ff59df27604e2587522a7abb52e667
msgid ""
"Feb 2012 - `Marco Robustini <https://www.youtube.com/user/erarius>`__ joins "
"as lead Copter tester"
msgstr ""
"2012 年 2 月 - `Marco Robustini <https://www.youtube.com/user/erarius>`__ 加入担任"
" Copter 首席测试员"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:104
#: 2c03cec3e6de4151b47fa61d285c0cd8
msgid ""
"July 2012 - `PX4 released <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/introducing-"
"the-px4-autopilot-system>`__ by \\ `ETH (Lorenz Meier,MikeS) "
"<https://pixhawk.org/>`__ / 3D Robotics"
msgstr ""
"2012 年 7 月 - `ETH（Lorenz Meier，MikeS） <https://pixhawk.org/>`__ / 3D "
"Robotics 发布 `PX4 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/introducing-the-"
"px4-autopilot-system>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:107
#: e5405d82ff5241269f722585acb72164
msgid ""
"Aug 2012 - Hardware Abstraction Layer (AP_HAL) by Pat Hickey simplifies "
"adding support for other boards"
msgstr "2012 年 8 月 - Pat Hickey 开发的硬件抽象层（AP_HAL）简化了对其他板卡的支持添加"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:110
#: 7d8b746eedc5444385a57d6b1ffebdd9
msgid ""
"Oct 2012 - First `TradHeli autonomous mission "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rugt1gYb-1M>`__ by Rob Lefebvre"
msgstr ""
"2012 年 10 月 - Rob Lefebvre 完成首次 `传统直升机自主任务 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rugt1gYb-1M>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:112
#: 0e9ab6e9c9b14789a0e58e22d2b92aeb
msgid ""
"Oct 2012 - Tridge and CanberraUAV `win Outback Challenge with APM2 & "
"Pandaboard <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/canberrauav-outback-"
"challenge-2012-debrief>`__"
msgstr ""
"2012 年 10 月 - Tridge 和 CanberraUAV `使用 APM2 和 Pandaboard 赢得 Outback "
"Challenge <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/canberrauav-outback-"
"challenge-2012-debrief>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:114
#: 6214cb6511c944008ae5a016717ef654
msgid "Nov 2012 - first APM2.5 clone appears"
msgstr "2012 年 11 月 - 首款 APM2.5 克隆出现"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:116
#: 0b0d7ac117df4efdad6155940982be5d
msgid ""
"Dec 2012 - Successfully prototype of 3rd order complementary filter by "
"Jonathan Challinger leads to Copter's inertial based altitude hold by Randy "
"and Leonard (`AC2.9 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-9-released>`__)."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 12 月 - Jonathan Challinger 成功原型测试三阶互补滤波器，促使 Randy 和 Leonard 基于惯性的 "
"Copter 高度保持开发（`AC2.9 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-9-released>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:121
#: 8f97f45af204466eb1573ff66f753f3b
msgid ""
"Jan 2013 - ArduPilot code moved from `google code "
"<http://code.google.com/p/ardupilot/>`__ to `github "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__"
msgstr ""
"2013 年 1 月 - ArduPilot 代码从 `google code "
"<http://code.google.com/p/ardupilot/>`__ 迁移到 `github "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:124
#: dce6182650424855845872d8ea149735
msgid ""
"Jan/Feb 2013 - Android GCSs appear (`DroidPlanner from Arthur "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/droidplanner-ground-control-station-"
"for-android-devices>`__, `AndroPilot from Kevin Hester "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/android-ground-controller-beta-"
"release>`__)"
msgstr ""
"2013 年 1/2 月 - Android 地面站出现（`Arthur 的 DroidPlanner "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/droidplanner-ground-control-station-"
"for-android-devices>`__、`Kevin Hester 的 AndroPilot "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/android-ground-controller-beta-"
"release>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:128
#: c98bacb86ef2471e81ca170c73bdd155
msgid ""
"Apr 2013 - :ref:`Plane L1 waypoint <plane:navigation-tuning>` following by "
"Paul Riseborough, Brandon Jones, Tridge"
msgstr ""
"2013 年 4 月 - Paul Riseborough、Brandon Jones、Tridge 实现 :ref:`Plane L1 航点 "
"<plane:navigation-tuning>` 跟随"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:131
#: 999a23e62f134dd48fd1bff4d75e737b
msgid ""
"May 2013 - Copter inertial navigation support for waypoint navigation by "
"Leonard and Randy (`AC3.0 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-3-0-1-released>`__)"
msgstr ""
"2013 年 5 月 - Leonard 和 Randy 实现 Copter 惯性导航航点导航支持（`AC3.0 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-3-0-1-released>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:135
#: c5fbab241fb44f4aba13335d5afb25ff
msgid ""
"Jul 2013 - Plane integrated speed and height control by Paul Riseborough, "
"Tridge"
msgstr "2013 年 7 月 - Paul Riseborough、Tridge 实现 Plane 速度与高度集成控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:138
#: f2f76b8e19c24e3289d1b78c4f091d6a
msgid ""
"Sep 2013 - `Flymaple <http://www.open-drone.org/flymaple>`__ board support "
"by Mike McCauley, Tridge"
msgstr ""
"2013 年 9 月 - Mike McCauley、Tridge 添加 `Flymaple <http://www.open-"
"drone.org/flymaple>`__ 板卡支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:141
#: ef16892ee8554899864d8f473c4c89cc
msgid ""
"Nov 2013 - `Pixhawk released "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/px4-and-3d-robotics-present-pixhawk-"
"an-advanced-user-friendly>`__ by `ETH (Lorenz Meier,MikeS) "
"<https://pixhawk.org/>`__/ 3D Robotics"
msgstr ""
"2013 年 11 月 - `ETH（Lorenz Meier，MikeS） <https://pixhawk.org/>`__/ 3D "
"Robotics 发布 `Pixhawk "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/px4-and-3d-robotics-present-pixhawk-"
"an-advanced-user-friendly>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:144
#: 0c0ab2b37a2b4e5bb01efc9d99e8b5a2
msgid ""
"Dec 2013 - `BeaglePilot project "
"<https://github.com/BeaglePilot/beaglepilot>`__ created by Víctor Mayoral "
"Vilches and Siddharth Bharat Purohit to port APM codebase to Linux. The "
"project was by Andrew Tridgell, Philip Rowse and others and funded by 3DR, "
"Google (through the Google Summer of Code) and BeagleBoard."
msgstr ""
"2013 年 12 月 - Víctor Mayoral Vilches 和 Siddharth Bharat Purohit 创建 "
"`BeaglePilot 项目 <https://github.com/BeaglePilot/beaglepilot>`__，将 APM 代码库移植到"
" Linux。该项目由 Andrew Tridgell、Philip Rowse 等人参与，并获得 3DR、Google（通过 Google "
"编程之夏）和 BeagleBoard 资助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:146
#: d7f52e3efd374044b4448fe7ca392a24
msgid ""
"Jan 2014 - Extended Kalman Filter added for more reliable attitude and "
"position information by Paul Riseborough, Tridge"
msgstr "2014 年 1 月 - Paul Riseborough、Tridge 添加扩展卡尔曼滤波器（EKF），以提供更可靠的姿态和位置信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-history-of-ardupilot.rst:149
